{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24170","headline":"送舒着作重授省郎赴阙 · 白居易","name":"送舒着作重授省郎赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三岁相依在洛都，游花宴月饱欢娱。\n惜别笙歌多怨咽，愿留轩盖少踟蹰。\n劒磨光彩依前出，鹏举风云逐後驱。\n从此求闲应不得，更能重醉白家无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}